<title>JAPAN: Sharp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sharp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		667.50		vs	  633.81</p>
<p> Operating	   28.61		vs	   27.95</p>
<p> Current	     36.11		vs	   35.04</p>
<p> Net		   20.93		vs	   19.84</p>
<p> EPS		   18.67 yen	  vs	   17.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.13 billion	  vs	1.11 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sharp Corp is a maker of consumer electronics and office automation equipment.</p>
</text>
